t3code
https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code

Ported or adapted into craze's Claude provider and ACP client:

- the list of a Claude Code session's identity variables removed from the
  environment of the Claude Code craze spawns
  (apps/server/src/provider/Drivers/ClaudeHome.ts;
  internal/agent/provider_claude.go);
- closing the tool calls a turn left open when its prompt fails or its agent
  exits (commits 47f90ee2e9 and 623047ccfd; internal/agent/live.go);
- the mapping of a Claude sub-agent's subagent_update states to a row's
  status, and session_message's id as the launching call's
  (packages/provider-acp-registry/src/server/claudeAcp.ts;
  internal/agent/claude_subagents.go);
- the ten-minute limit on a turn that sends nothing with a tool call open
  (packages/provider-core/src/server/failure.ts; internal/acp/foreign.go);
- the reading of a Claude rate limit's extra usage as allowed or in use
  (apps/server/src/orchestration-v2/Adapters/ClaudeAdapterV2.ts;
  internal/acp/claude_usage.go).

